The optional integrations remain the work of their authors: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3757331189]Valtora's Ship's Water[/url], [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3789049955]LOGUSS's Common Sense modules[/url] and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3788237703]jossla's Study at Terminals[/url]. Linking to them does not imply their endorsement.
Original artwork uses AI-assisted production; provenance and licensing are recorded separately.

